  "system": {
    "identifier": "step-of-savagery",
    "description": "<p>As an action, you can spend up to 4 Martial Die and move up to your full movement speed in a straight line, passing through any creatures you encounter. When you do, they must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, they take [Unarmed Damage] + Martial Die equal to the spent amount, are knocked prone and pulled with you to the end of your movement, ending in a space of your choice, adjacent to you that can hold them. This does not affect creatures two or more sizes larger than you.</p>",
